Package: dh360d
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-serial, python3-psutil
Description: Linux driver for the Darkflash DH360D AIO LCD ("DH space station")
 Drives the small LCD on the Darkflash DH360D liquid-cooler pump from Linux,
 showing live CPU temperature, CPU usage and RAM usage on the screen.
 .
 The vendor only ships a Windows application. This package speaks the same
 serial protocol over the cooler's WCH CH340 USB-to-UART bridge, and installs a
 systemd service that streams host sensors to the screen and starts on boot.
 A udev rule grants access and creates a stable /dev/dh360d symlink.
